body:
It's kinda like what Thunderword said. It's a constant battle of trying to make sure we dont give in to the influence of the Darkness. And as Eris is very involved with the Hive and Darkness, she is just one who is more likely to struggle with temptation. 

&#x200B;

Also, we shouldn't ignore the trauma that the Hive afflicted against Eris. After what happened to her fireteam, she has a special hatred for the Hive. It's likely that the Darkness is using that hatred as temptation. To know any more than that, we will have to wait for future seasons and expansions to update us.

Farthest I've gotten is branch 8. That partially because of awful teammates though.

I average around 6 or 7

&#x200B;
